    turnFlow: "1. **Start**: The first tile played determines the trump suit (Blanks). 2. **Tricks**: Players play one tile each. Highest trump wins; if no trump, highest card of led suit wins. 3. **The Draw**: While the stock exists, players draw one tile after each trick. 4. **Trump**: The double-blank (Bingo) is the highest trump, followed by other tiles with blanks. 5. **Closing**: A player may 'close the stock' to stop drawing and force strict suit-following.",
